commit e3580505d5067bd0e608523fe9843a7c2a30b287

C03: keep the memory activation message's prior wording; the new cause fact made its composition fail (MEMORY1249)

With «private local memory setting changed» as the state text, every draft of
the memory.enable completion was rejected (reversed_result / forbidden_term)
until retries ran out, so the two-phase save ended without a final. The
save completion itself composed correctly («Confirmado. Voy a recordarlo:
Reta.»). No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


